SUMMARY:Pottery on the Plaza
DESCRIPTION:Pottery on the Plaza            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n			\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Wednesdays\, Thursdays\, Fridays\, and Saturdays. All summer!\n11:00 am – 3:00 pm\nFree for kids and Gardiner Members\nIncluded with admission for adults and seniors \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Pottery on the Plaza is back! Throughout the summer\, join us in front of the Museum to experiment with clay outdoors. Visitors of all ages are invited to take part in this self-guided activity. \nWe recommend bringing a recycled container or bag in which to transport your work home. \nPlease note: This program is weather permitting. In the event of inclement weather\, Pottery on the Plaza will be cancelled. Please check the Programs & Events page for the most up-to-date schedule. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/pottery-on-the-plaza-august-1-2026/
LOCATION:Gardiner Museum\, 111 Queen's Park\, Toronto\, ON\, M5S 2C7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Family Days,Programs & Events
